 Welcome to CBtrends.com 

 CBtrends.com is a free research tool that allows the ClickBank affiliates to see the "true" side of all listed in Marketplace products. Nothing defines the quality of a product better than the feedback of affiliates who already tried promoting it or of the customers who bought and tried it. 

 ClickBank Marketplace contains thousands of ready to promote digital products. Some of those products are very good, 
 other are not that good to say the least. And it is very difficult to tell about the quality of a product judging only 
 by the sales pitch page. 

 Finding products that are of high quality, convert well, and profitable takes a lot of time, money, and effort. Use 
 CBtrends.com to view the performance history of any product listed in the ClickBank Marketplace. Make your life easier 
 and get the feedback from thousands of affiliates and customers from around the world - NUMBERS NEVER LIE. 

 CBtrends.com is a completely FREE ClickBank products history tracking tool that allows you to: 

 Browse the ClickBank products listed in the ClickBank marketplace by categories. The results can be ordered the products 
 Popularity Rank, Gravity, Earned Per Sale, Percent Per Sale, Commission, or Referred values. This gives you an ability 
 to quickly locate products that give you the most dollar value per sale, that are popular among other affiliates, that 
 are under-marketed, and etc.

 Look up a particular vendor by a Vendor Id. This is a particular useful tool as it allows you to check any vendor product 
 performance history. The Popularity, Gravity, Earned Per Sale, Percent Per Sale, Commission, and Referred values history 
 trends are availiable.

 Search the ClickBank marketplace for products using keywords or even sentences as search conditions. Of course, the search 
 results can be ordered by Popularity Rank, Gravity, Earned Per Sale, Percent Per Sale, Commission, or Referred values.

 View the list of the top one hundred most researched ClickBank products. This gives you a sneak peek into what other 
 ClickBank marketers are doing.

 Download the list of new products and even auto generate the hoplinks with your Affiliate Id. ClickBank adds new product to 
 the marketplace on a daily basis. CBtrends makes those new products availiable to you the same day thay are added to the 
 marketplace.

 The ClickBank Marketplace database is updated DAILY - There is absolutely NO delay in making data available. Thus, you are getting 
 the Latest Available Data taken directly from ClickBank Marketplace XML feeds. 

